// Words reserved family-wide but not used by typl (typl reference §1.4). The
// lexer maps every one to ReservedWord, so they can never be identifiers in a
// .typl file even though .typl rejects the declarations they belong to.
interface service signal event command query
fixed states during
require ensure
model function let last case if then else when emit merge current state
transition automaton
system component distribution deployment machine offers requires for
